# Settings and secrets no longer live in the repo root.
# Each agent has its own folder with agent.yaml (settings) and .env (secrets).
# Create yours with:   python scripts/new_agent.py
# Optional, in your shell: LOCALAGENT_DIR=<path>  (agent folder; default ./my-agent)
#                          HF_HOME=<path>         (model cache; default ./models)
